# Q1274 repair-r100 stage-packet manifest — SHA-256 of every sealed payload file.
# src/pp_host.h, src/ppgpu.cu, and src/build.sh remain byte-identical to the
# upstream gpu-port-q1274-repair-r100/CORE.sha256 qualification. The current
# src/pp_model.h, src/pp_phase_cpu.h, src/ppcpu.cpp, and
# src/phasepostfilter.cpp contain the default-off CPU phase/postfilter extension;
# the original upstream pp_model/ppcpu hashes were respectively
# 68aa572a4fd84742b258560f3629798cf65849aed461af266642bde99d05432f and
# f25a1d8a459810b02ce071e8bef1334f1abddac9e49dd013a8744b089b04a79a.
# fixtures.local.tsv == upstream QUALIFICATION_SETS.tsv (323-row classical ledger).
# PARITY_FIXTURES.tsv == q1274-repair-r100-packet/PARITY_FIXTURES.tsv (manifest 5cdc29d0...).
# PHASE_FIXTURES.tsv and PHASE_D32_FIXTURES.tsv bind exact complete CPU
# clean-phase sets under the conditional phase&~classical contract.
